@startuml
title 06  一次性任务 · 执行状态与退出
skinparam backgroundColor #F9FBFE
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontColor #14273E
skinparam ArrowColor #446483
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam componentBorderColor #7595B4
skinparam nodeBorderColor #7896B2
skinparam databaseBorderColor #7896B2
skinparam artifactBorderColor #7896B2
hide empty description
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #EAF2FF
    BorderColor #7595B4
    FontColor #14273E
}
state "启动 / 读配置" as Start
state "SDK 初始化" as Boot
state "运行 Agent" as Running
state "保存结果" as Persist
state "关闭 DSH" as Close
state "退出 0" as Ok #DDF2E9
state "非零退出" as Failed #FBECEC

[*] --> Start : DiOS 启动 task 容器
Start --> Boot : 配置通过
Start --> Failed : 缺失或非法配置
Boot --> Running : 初始化完成
Boot --> Close : 初始化失败或收到停止信号
Running --> Persist : 确认任务完成
Running --> Close : 失败、超时或收到停止信号
Persist --> Close : 记录产物落盘结果
Close --> Ok : 执行成功且产物已写入
Close --> Failed : 失败 / 中断或产物写入失败
Ok --> [*]
Failed --> [*]

note right of Running
  DiAgent 负责 SDK 子进程收尾。
  DiOS 当前 A2A 取消更新业务状态，
  容器停止仍需从 DiOS 接到实际句柄。
end note
@enduml
